    description: 'Anthem advanced-imaging request explicitly under Carelon review: clinical indication documented',
    severity: 'info',
    citation: 'Anthem states that its health plans may use Carelon Medical Benefits Management guidelines for some procedures and certain members. This informational check therefore runs only when the packet establishes that Carelon imaging review applies; it does not infer delegation from every radiology code. <https://www.anthem.com/provider/policies/clinical-guidelines/>',
