    citation: 'Anthem publishes drug-specific Clinical Criteria for injectable, infused, or implanted therapies under the medical benefit and directs providers to select the applicable drug and dose. This informational check runs only when the packet says those criteria apply; it does not infer a universal ICD-10 requirement from every J-code. <https://www.anthem.com/pharmacy-information/for-providers/clinical-criteria>',
