    citation: 'BCBSIL says some medications under the pharmacy benefit require prior authorization through Prime, but the reviewed current Commercial summary does not establish step therapy or a universal prior-trial packet requirement for every drug. This advisory runs only when the packet explicitly says step therapy applies. <https://www.bcbsil.com/docs/provider/il/claims/um/2026-commercial-pa-summary.pdf>',
