    citation: 'BCBSIL says Medical Oncology & Supportive Care requests through Carelon receive medical-necessity review for oncology drugs supported by an oncology diagnosis. Member, product, and drug requirements still vary. Informational. <https://www.bcbsil.com/docs/provider/il/claims/um/2026-commercial-pa-summary.pdf>',
