    citation: 'BCBSIL defines a provider appeal as a request to reconsider a previous denial and distinguishes clinical appeals of adverse medical-necessity or experimental / investigational determinations from non-clinical appeals. This operational advisory asks an explicit clinical authorization appeal to identify the determination being challenged. <https://www.bcbsil.com/provider/claims/claims-eligibility/claim-review>',
