    citation: 'Highmark applies site-of-care clinical review to procedures and products named by Medical Policies Z-109 and Z-129, subject to member benefits. For an explicitly in-scope hospital-outpatient request, Highmark considers patient complexity, access, continuing treatment, and written clinical justification. <https://providers.highmark.com/communications-hub/news-and-updates/reminder-changes-occurring-in-2026>',
