    citation: 'CareFirst routes most prior authorizations through its Provider Portal. An initial request cannot already contain a submission confirmation, so this tracking advisory runs only when the packet says submission is complete. <https://provider.carefirst.com/providers/medical/in-network-precertification-preauthorization.page>',
