    citation: 'CareFirst\'s current Utilization Management Request for Authorization Form asks for a letter of medical necessity explaining why services cannot be provided in-network when out-of-network services are requested for a BlueChoice member. Other CareFirst products can include out-of-network benefits, so this informational check is limited to explicit BlueChoice requests. <https://provider.carefirst.com/carefirst-resources/provider/pdf/utilization-management-request-authorization-form-prd1108.pdf> <https://provider.carefirst.com/carefirst-resources/provider/pdf/programs-and-products.pdf>',
