    description: 'Blue Cross NC outpatient advanced-imaging request: clinical indication documented',
    severity: 'info',
    citation: 'Blue Cross NC routes diagnostic-imaging authorization through Blue e and notes that Carelon program enrollment varies by member group. This informational check asks an outpatient MRI, CT, PET, or nuclear-cardiology request for its clinical indication without inferring program eligibility from every radiology code. <https://www.bcbsnc.com/providers/prior-authorization/request-ppa> <https://www.bcbsnc.com/providers/policies-guidelines-codes/cpt-service-codes>',
