    citation: 'Blue Cross and Blue Shield of Louisiana directs providers to submit prior-authorization requests through the iLinkBlue provider portal or Availity, by 278 EDI transaction, or by phone using the number on the member ID card. Informational: a cover sheet that names the channel speeds routing. <https://www.lablue.com/providers>',
