    citation: 'Louisiana Blue routes high-tech imaging authorization through Carelon: CT, MRI, MRA, nuclear cardiology, and PET. A Gold Card provider, one requesting at least 50 cases a year at a 95 to 99 percent approval rating, is always approved for those services but must still submit the request for claim payment and annual audit, and an audited case is asked to upload documentation supporting medical necessity. <https://providers.lablue.com/-/media/Files/Providers/Professional%20Provider%20Office%20Manual/2025/Prof%20Manual%202025%20Section%204%20pdf.pdf>',
