    citation: 'Louisiana Blue contracts with Express Scripts to perform prior authorizations for targeted medical-benefit drugs on its Preferred Care PPO and HMO Louisiana networks, and handles non-targeted medications itself. The manual publishes no universal diagnosis requirement for every physician-administered drug, so this advisory runs on a packet that names a drug authorization workflow. <https://providers.lablue.com/-/media/Files/Providers/Professional%20Provider%20Office%20Manual/2025/Prof%20Manual%202025%20Section%204%20pdf.pdf>',
