    citation: 'Louisiana Blue directs a provider addressing the coverage eligibility or investigational status of a treatment, procedure, device, drug, or biological product in a medical policy to submit a written request stating the nature of the inquiry AND pertinent peer-reviewed scientific evidence-based outcomes specific to it. Its criteria ask whether the technology has evidence permitting conclusions about health outcomes, improves the net health outcome, is as beneficial as an established alternative, or shows improvement outside investigational settings. <https://providers.lablue.com/-/media/Files/Providers/Professional%20Provider%20Office%20Manual/2025/Prof%20Manual%202025%20Section%204%20pdf.pdf>',
