    citation: 'Michigan Medicaid is explicit about what a transplant needs: "The letter of authorization for the transplant from the Office of Medical Affairs (OMA) or MHP must be attached to all applicable transplant claims, otherwise payment is denied," with "PA letter submitted" indicated in the claim Remarks. Heart, liver, lung, simultaneous pancreas/kidney, kidney, and pancreas transplants are reimbursed at the hospital cost-to-charge ratio. <https://www.mdch.state.mi.us/dch-medicaid/manuals/MedicaidProviderManual.pdf>',
